<title>CANADA: Hudson's Bay Co April 30 Q1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Hudson's Bay Co April 30 Q1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended April 30</p>
<p>				1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	C$0.45     loss	C$0.91</p>
<p> Net	   loss	27,092     loss	53,419</p>
<p> Revs		   1,230,691		1,197,827</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Previous first quarter loss included a restructuring charge of C$0.62 a share. Without the charge it totalled C$0.29 a share.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
